  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/ZTPypJTODeVAw4Sknw1gYqwlXwR0cPKeqVFsEQuWyXZP8VONUDFEl9dI0HWX1OuX3QS2VM8JpY3dvLg5F0rliwd7KRX0jS7WhQCAgd3WAFZaMo4ixalngZyYawyijVxOzoKhGhX45J6xXeh3GIqYD98p6mbdIfsOCh3X4iJYoIX0GpgKAtCRH79Q8zXKyR7WlQbiVXJw\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/230/4310093414f770fd6a30027fc9e46a98..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">うまれたよー！！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日はこさめの誕生日です</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私は自分の誕生日がだいすき！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">誕生日がくるのはちょっと</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">つらいけど…（苦笑）</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">7月7日は七夕だよね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">逆張りオタクだからね、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">まず、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">その七夕の前日にうまれたっていうのが</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">嬉しすぎる。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私は、彦星と織姫の</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">脇役になりたくないのでね…！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">（そんなことはないです）</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/ON8lWxyxVz1R60yN5slwUG4lN1M8x917I4upBV2KwGyd0f7oHDpa18F6MlNp6AaJQul6c3xKkJYscC2hNxfANzudBQrd7uEWZxFNivivYhOT6MJCbSdSqw3uoTALDSeOtfJIfL0neBF1a92fYq1mkvIEBkcLZ5UC5Wk2mKLd4fv7rKSMuWRzpycCYaaxSfiQ74lcaA33\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/230/01b5e709a2238ee14566c51b7ced1b65..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">新17歳の顔つき。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">顔がちょっと盛れて嬉しかった。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">尚、白背景は…（つらい）</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">深夜帯に撮影行ったんだけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">同期とか後輩ちゃんとか</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">仲いい子いっぱいいて嬉しかった🥰</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">お給仕入ればよかったーとも思ったけどさ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">前日にはみんなに会えて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">当日には大好きな人達に会えて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">全部が満点なんだな</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">幸せです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/kuS5yNJXoqfKIqvNaLaQrPPJWRR41yRIMKKATfK6br5BeeZ41kPYpldYSaRtm6o6dVZEJ1ftvASoJ2S3UQQQVM36La02CHhNvsDjd8flznnf0bzl4NzPiMfhiPdPXnJg0skJrxvzRU4pbZOpEL7mbuZpAwKr8YaYJXN6hka4weqwRphwrlGWC6frp5xT4BD3cZDwFFki\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/230/959ffc56b7e5a128cbd0f27226d5bb5e..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">新17歳のこさめもよろしくね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いっぱいのおめでとうを</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ありがとうでした！</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
